 531               /       THE FOLLOWING IS THE SPECIAL ENTRY POINT FOR THE KEYBOARD MONITOR. IT IS
 532               /       DELIBERATELY PLACED WITHIN THE "ROM" AREA (WHICH STARTED ONE WORD AGO)
 533               /       AS A DELIBERATE MEASURE TO CAUSE RELOAD IN CASE THE OVERLAY IS PARTIALLY
 534               /       CLOBBERED, BUT NOT WITHIN THE "ROM" AREA. SHOULD THE MONITOR INITIALIZATION
 535               /       FAIL TO COMPLETE, THIS LOCATION WILL BE NON-ZERO, THUS FURTHER ATTEMPTS
 536               /       TO REBOOT THE SYSTEM WILL RELOAD THE OVERLAY. THIS ENTRY WILL INITIALIZE
 537               /       THE MONITOR'S CONSOLE ROUTINES TO CALL THE OVERLAY, AND WILL INTERCEPT
 538               /       ALL SYSTEM READ/WRITE I/O ACCORDING TO THE DICTATES OF THE TRAP BLOCKS.
 539               
